      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每种食材解锁一张卡，料理直接变成冒险者牌组",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The dishes you serve will build your Caretaker’s deck – each ingredient unlocking a card. And once they’ve eaten, they’ll venture into the wilds to fight the monsters.",
