      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用风味相生相克打出戏法牌式回合战斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Fight the monsters in turn-based deck building combat, inspired by traditional trick-taking card games. Outplay the monsters, by matching their flavour magic or neutralising it with a balancing card.",
